  m_Name: Dinosaure
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LetterData
  contentList:
  - I hope you're ready for Christmas!  Since I can't travel in time to go back to
    Jurassic Era, may I ask you to bring me another dinosaur? You're amazing!
  - "I hope you're excited for Christmas just like I am!  I\u2019m dreaming of a
    tiny creature from ancient times to roam my room again."
